    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_0060_head_teacher_04",
      "hash64": "0FF6C4F97A03EDF0",
      "text": "Oh, l’heure tourne. J’aurais aimé rester pendant\\nque vous réfléchissez à votre choix, mais\\r\\nle devoir m’appelle ailleurs.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_0060_head_teacher_05",
      "hash64": "0FF6C5F97A03EFA3",
      "text": "Je dois me rendre dans cette maison. Lorsque\\nvous aurez fait votre choix, rejoignez-moi là-bas.\\c\\nProfitez de ce temps pour réfléchir. C’est une\\ndécision qui ne doit pas être prise à la légère.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 194,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_0060_head_teacher_06",
      "hash64": "0FF6C6F97A03F156",
      "text": "Sur ces belles paroles, à tout à l’heure.\\nMes hommages, madame.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "common_0060_mama_01",
      "hash64": "3C5488FF337D9E1E",
      "text": "Ça alors, le proviseur de ton école est vraiment\\ntrès poli ![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "common_0060_mama_02",
      "hash64": "3C5487FF337D9C6B",
      "text": "Tu dois choisir un Pokémon parmi ces trois-là ?\\nÇa ne va pas être facile, ils sont tous si mignons ![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "common_0060_mama_03",
      "hash64": "3C5486FF337D9AB8",
      "text": "Mais puisque tu as le temps, pourquoi ne pas\\nte balader avec eux ?[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "common_0060_mama_04",
      "hash64": "3C548DFF337DA69D",
      "text": "Comme ça, tu en apprendras peut-être plus\\nsur ces Pokémon ![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "common_0060_mama_05",
      "hash64": "3C548CFF337DA4EA",
      "text": "Oh, et une dernière chose... Maman t’a acheté\\nun petit cadeau pour célébrer ton premier jour\\r\\nd’école ! Garde-le toujours sur toi, d’accord ?[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "common_0060_mama_06",
      "hash64": "3C548BFF337DA337",
      "text": "C’est un téléphone dernier cri.\\nVoyons voir la notice...\\c\\n« Appuyez sur le [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]bouton Y[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] si vous avez perdu\\nvotre chemin... »\\r\\nOh, c’est une Carte ! Voilà qui te sera très utile !\\c\\nPrends bien soin de ton nouveau gadget ![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
